      "section_title": "9.9 设置账户保护和会话安全参数",
      "block_type": "list",
      "text": "•\n非法访问次数：限制用户尝试登录的最大次数。如输入密码错误次数超过指定值，账号将\n自动被锁定。（参数范围：5~20 次；默认值：5）",
      "table_cells": null,
      "bbox": [
        101.737,
        593.703,
        466.912,
        618.156
      ],
      "extraction_method": "native_text",
      "needs_review": false,
      "review_notes": []
    },
    {
      "block_id": "BLK-B284674F56F08961",
      "document_id": "DOC-D9C0DEB31D45",
      "source_sha256": "bd8dee22b45f3effc4323f330fd4db2eb92ab544cc41fc56835e0e5cd8eec71d",
